 ],
 "_dust": "the rig's sun-bleached dust is (0.66, 0.60, 0.50) linear, a pale beige laid on every flat top; on the map that is the beige wash rule 137 bans. Here it is concrete dust, grey: the grime and the film stay, the beige goes.",
