 "snap_keep_chroma": 18,
 "_snap": "the pull toward his pack colours (the props' 0.35, the map's 0.15 on 10/23) is 0.06, and a pixel with chroma past 18 is not pulled at all: his packs are mostly tan, and a pull toward them is a pull toward the sand.",
